---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import NeuralField from '../components/NeuralField.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Base home>
  <main class="stage">
    <NeuralField />
    <div class="panel" id="content">
      <h1>Radin Khayyam</h1>
      <p class="position">
        Electrical engineering at Sharif, now an MSc at Koç University: learning theory, and applications of AI.
      </p>
      <p class="intro">
        I studied electrical engineering at Sharif University of Technology, and in October 2026 I started an MSc in
        artificial intelligence at Koç University in Istanbul, on the Presidential Fellowship. The primary work, with
        Prof. Zafer Doğan in the MLIP group, is learning theory: generalization, classical theory beside modern deep
        models, and learning from structured data rather than i.i.d. samples. Applications, including biomedical signals
        and the systems I built at Solico Group, are the second track.
      </p>
      <ul class="panel-links">
        <li><a href="/about">About</a></li>
        <li><a href="/research">Research</a></li>
        <li><a href="/projects">Projects</a></li>
        <li><a href="/writing">Writing</a></li>
      </ul>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>Email</a>
        <a href="/cv">Curriculum vitae</a>
      </div>
      <div class="featured">
        <article>
          <h2>Hand trajectory from EEG</h2>
          <p>
            ICBME 2024, with Mohammad B. Shamsollahi. A comparison of methods for estimating a hand’s path in 3D from
            EEG.
          </p>
          <p class="link-row">
            <a href={site.paper}>Paper</a>
            <a href={site.slides}>Slides</a>
          </p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h2>Applied systems at Solico Group</h2>
          <p>
            Retrieval, ranking, and a shopping assistant using retrieval-augmented generation and LoRA. August 2025 to
            September 2026.
          </p>
          <p class="link-row">
            <a href="/projects">Project notes</a>
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
